This product includes software developed by:
- screenpipe/audiopipe (MIT) — speech-to-text inference layer
- llama-cpp-2 / llama.cpp (MIT) — LLM inference (M5 swaps to mistral.rs)
- ort (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — ONNX Runtime bindings (used by audiopipe Parakeet engine)
- mlx-rs (Apache-2.0) — MLX bindings (used by audiopipe Parakeet MLX engine on Apple Silicon)
- cpal (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) — cross-platform microphone capture
- Tauri (MIT OR Apache-2.0) — app shell
- Svelte (MIT) — frontend framework

This product can use the following speech-to-text models at the user's choice:
- NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v3 (CC-BY-4.0) — https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v3
- Alibaba Qwen3-ASR 0.6B (Apache-2.0) — https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-0.6B
- OpenAI Whisper large-v3-turbo (MIT) — https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo

Model weights are downloaded by the user at first run; no model is bundled
with the application.

